      "raw_text": "transactions which incrementally modify it-“in privately and securely modify Quisquis [5] all TXOs (even those which have been which have been entirety of the is a paradigm for private payment, pro- ¨ account state in only from some account whose secret key the prover ( y overspends, excessively y y",
